diff --git a/README.en.md b/README.en.md
index 27c8517..e7959de 100644
--- a/README.en.md
+++ b/README.en.md
@@ -88,6 +88,15 @@ vendor runtime. The generic AIstone/MSI restore-tool settings become optional
 at build time, so package builders that cannot reach the Nahimic support site
 can still produce a working desktop build.
 
+The same installer's Nahimic3 app bundle carries the vendor equalizer presets
+(`Settings/v1/EQPresets`, installed under `eqpresets`). The control panel shows
+one preset row per audio profile — Music: Dynamic, Heavy Bass, Brilliant,
+Vocals; Movie: Dialogues, Immersion; Gaming: Fast-paced, Atmospheric,
+FPS Competition, Racing; Communication: Balanced, Clear Chat, Livestream —
+using the display names the Windows panel localizes. Choosing a preset writes
+all ten band gains in one store update; moving a slider switches the selection
+back to Custom, exactly like the Windows panel.
+
 ## Contribute device support
 
 Read [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) first. Include your laptop model, audio hardware IDs, PipeWire output information, and results from testing effect switching, settings persistence, service restarts, and continuous playback. Each model needs a configuration matching its hardware. New device support should be verified on the actual machine before submitting a pull request.
diff --git a/README.md b/README.md
index 8b6b705..f41c594 100644
--- a/README.md
+++ b/README.md
@@ -68,6 +68,8 @@ APO3 文件来自现有固定版本恢复工具归档，与 APO4 的运行组件
 
 [ASRock Nahimic(v1.10.11_APO4)](https://download.asrock.com/Utility/Others/Nahimic(v1.10.11_APO4).zip) 扩展驱动覆盖的 ASRock 主板使用其 APO4 `Generic_ExternalSpeakers` 配置。厂商对所有 `AVoluteNH3Ext.inf` 所列主板共用同一份外接扬声器调校，因此全部 HDA 子系统均在匹配之列（`18491897` 已在 B650M-H/M.2+（Realtek ALC897）上验证；`18492897`、`18496899`、`18498899` 及 ALC1220 主板 `18492229`–`1849222d` 依据 INF）。线路输出端口兼容 PipeWire path 配置与 UCM 命名；插入耳机时旁路音效，HDMI 等其他输出保持原有路径。构建使用 `innoextract` 从 ASRock 安装包提取设置，ASRock 原厂设置保存在 `factory-asrock`，与 APO4 共享运行组件并列。通用 AIstone/MSI 恢复工具设置在构建时变为可选，无法访问 Nahimic 支持站点的打包者仍可完成台式机构建。
 
+同一安装包内的 Nahimic3 应用还带有厂商均衡器预设（`Settings/v1/EQPresets`，安装到 `eqpresets`）。控制面板在每个音效模式下显示对应的预设按钮——音乐：增加动态、强化低音、增强明亮、人声增强；电影：对白增强、更加沉浸；游戏：节奏紧凑、氛围强化、第一人称射击、极限竞速；通话：平衡语音、通话清晰、实况转播——并沿用 Windows 面板的本地化名称。选择预设会一次性写入全部十个频段增益；手动拖动滑块后自动回到自定义，与 Windows 面板一致。
+
 ## 贡献设备适配
 
 请先阅读 [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md)。提交机器型号、声卡硬件 ID、PipeWire 输出信息，以及音效开关、参数保存、服务重启和连续播放的测试结果。每个型号使用与硬件匹配的配置，新增支持以本机验证为依据。
